  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "感謝祭当日……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-2:caption",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ようこそ、感謝祭へ。日頃の感謝を込めて、\n今日は僕なりにおもてなしさせてもらうよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この料理、とっても美味しい……！\nソースは何を使ってるんですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ファンA"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（都築さん、料理について覚えてきたのだろうか。\n……わたしから、もっと伝えておけばよかった）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（よし、ここはわたしが行こう。\n都築さんだけでは不安だ……！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すみません！　飲み物の種類が\nたくさんありますけど、どれがお勧めですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "ファンB"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "は、はい。少々お待ちください。\n本日のお勧めは……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "数分後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-28:caption",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（結局、都築さんのサポートはできなかったが……。\nどうやら、心配はいらなかったようだ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "都築さん。先ほどの説明、聞こえていました。\nとても素晴らしい内容で……正直驚きました。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……Cafe Paradeのみんなとのレッスンで、\n気づいたんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "自分の心を……感謝の気持ちを吹き込める、\n料理という作品の素晴らしさにね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうしたら、彼らの作品についてもっと\n知りたくなって……僕なりに勉強してみたんだけど。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-40:text",
        "step_id": 40,
        "step_index": 39,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 39
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "少しは、感謝祭の役に立てたかな？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-41:text",
        "step_id": 41,
        "step_index": 40,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 40
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ！　きっと都築さんの説明のおかげで、\nより料理が美味しくなったと思います。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神楽 麗"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_g:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 42,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ、そうだといいね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "都築 圭"
      },
